{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16081","headline":"题花子赠渭州陈判官 · 王建","name":"题花子赠渭州陈判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腻如云母轻如粉，艳胜香黄薄胜蝉。\n点绿斜蒿新叶嫩，添红石竹晚花鲜。\n鸳鸯比翼人初帖，蛱蝶重飞样未传。\n况复萧郎有情思，可怜春日镜台前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}